| MarkdownRenderer | `chat/MarkdownRenderer.js` | `common/MarkdownRenderer.js` (differs) | `common/MarkdownRenderer.js` (differs) | **CANONICALIZE** | Three copies → one. Standardize on `react-markdown` + `remark-gfm` + syntax highlighter. |
| ClickToEditMarkdown | (not present) | `common/ClickToEditMarkdown.js` (differs) | `common/ClickToEditMarkdown.js` | **CANONICALIZE** | Reconcile RE vs AF; remove RE-specific session-dispatch coupling. |
