| PendingReasonPopover | `shared/PendingReasonPopover.js` | (not present) | (not present) | **LIFT-AND-GENERALIZE** | Remove OpenTEAM-specific resolution logic; expose `resolutions[]` + `onResolve(reason, value)` as props. |
| Breadcrumb | `chat/Breadcrumb.js` | (not present) | (not present) | **PROMOTE** | Already generic. |
| BackendSelector | `chat/BackendSelector.js` | (different in AgentStatusBar) | (different in AgentStatusBar) | **LIFT-AND-GENERALIZE** | Extract a `<ModelSelector value options onChange />`. |
| FileViewer | `layout/FileViewer.js` | `layout/FileViewer.js` (differs) | `layout/FileViewer.js` (differs) | **CANONICALIZE** | Three copies → one. |
| FolderTree | `layout/FolderTree.js` | (not present; workspace tree inline) | (not present) | **PROMOTE** | Generic file-tree primitive. |
| ConnectionStatusBar | `layout/ConnectionStatusBar.js` | (different; in AgentStatusBar) | (different; in AgentStatusBar) | **LIFT-AND-GENERALIZE** | Standalone connection status pill. |
| AppHeader | (none) | `layout/AppHeader.js` (differs) | `layout/AppHeader.js` (differs) | **CANONICALIZE** | Reconcile RE vs AF; strip RE-specific menu items. |
| SettingsDrawer | `layout/SettingsDrawer.js` | (none) | (none) | **KEEP-IN-APP** | OpenTEAM-specific settings. |
| Sidebar | `layout/Sidebar.js` | (different — SessionSidebar) | (different — SessionSidebar) | **KEEP-IN-APP** | OpenTEAM session/task semantics; SessionSidebar in AF stays separate. |

