| NodeDetailPanel | `chat/NodeDetailPanel.js` | (none) | (none) | **PROMOTE** | Useful agent-reasoning detail. |
| SessionContextBar | `chat/SessionContextBar.js` | (none) | (none) | **KEEP-IN-APP** | OpenTEAM session/project/sprint coupling. |
| MultiViewTaskPanel | (none) | `agent/MultiViewTaskPanel.js` | (none) | **KEEP-IN-APP** | RE Plan v3 multi-view; pattern documented for future generalization. |
| PipelineStatusBar | (none) | `agent/PipelineStatusBar.js` | (none) | **KEEP-IN-APP** | RE pipeline domain. |
| ViewTabBar | (none) | `agent/ViewTabBar.js` | (none) | **PROMOTE** | Tab bar is generic. |

